        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Bilibino Nuclear Power Plant\n- Products: Akademik Lomonosov floating nuclear power station\n- People: Mikhail Lomonosov\n- Events: Bilibino Nuclear Power Plant shutdown plans\n\nFacts:\n- Plans were announced to begin a shutdown procedure for the Bilibino Nuclear Power Plant in 2019.\n- The Bilibino Nuclear Power Plant was to be replaced by the Akademik Lomonosov floating nuclear power station.\n- The Akademik Lomonosov floating nuclear power station is named after Mikhail Lomonosov.\n- Mikhail Lomonosov was a Russian polymath, scientist, and writer who discovered the atmosphere of Venus.",
